\newlabel{fig:fig3-4-superposed}{{9}{21}{Estimation paths \( T \mapsto \hat {l}(T) \), \( \hat {a}(T) \), and \( \hat {s}(T) \) under a general asymmetric Laplace noise model with skewness parameter \( z \in \{-0.9, -0.5, 0, 0.5, 0.9\} \) and fixed signal-to-noise ratio \( \mathrm {SNR} = 1000 \). Rows correspond to quantile levels \( \tau \in \{0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 0.95\} \), columns correspond to estimated parameters. True parameter values \( (L, A, S) = (22, 1, 10) \) are indicated by dashed horizontal lines}{figure.caption.11}{}}
